  ("How much does HomeStars cost for contractors?", "New pros pay no joining or membership fee. You pay a lead fee only when a homeowner shortlists you, and the fee is shown before you respond. HomeStars does not publish a price list because each fee depends on the job details."),
  ("Do I pay HomeStars if I don't get the job?", "Yes, if the homeowner shortlisted you. The fee pays for the shortlist and contact details, not the job. Expressing interest is free, so you control your spend by choosing which jobs to respond to."),
